# DECSTBM — VT510 §DECSTBM (DEC private; xterm ctlseqs "Set Scrolling
# Region"): CSI Pt ; Pb r sets the top and bottom margins, one-based on the
# wire, and homes the cursor — which is why "x" overwrites the T of "TOP".
# A line feed at the bottom margin scrolls only within the margins (VT100
# User Guide, "Scrolling Region"): TOP above and BOTTOM below stay put, and
# nothing goes to the scrollback because the region is not the whole screen.
TOP
\e[5;1HBOTTOM
\e[2;4r
x
\e[2;1H
aa\r\nbb\r\ncc\r\ndd
